 ①不需要， ②需要\n(4) (2 分) mgL,"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {1}{2} (\\mathrm{M} + \\mathrm{m}) \\left[ \\left(\\frac {\\mathrm{d}}{\\Delta t _ {2}}\\right) ^ {2} - \\left(\\frac {\\mathrm{d}}{\\Delta t _ {1}}\\right) ^ {2} \\right]"},{"type":"text","value":"14-Ⅱ.（7分）答案：\n(1) (1 分)"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9e4df90c5a3b79fb6e64b9eb2606aa711b577586b2339c922e6e102d7f76f2fc.png","width":457,"height":333,"width_mm":58},{"type":"text","value":"(2) (1 分) 200\n（4）（3分）横纵轴物理量和单位正确1分，数据点描在坐标纸中的位置合理1分，图像画为直线1分。原理解析："},{"type":"math","value":"U_{1}=IR=E-I(r+r_{g})"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"U_{2}=I(R+r_{g})=E-Ir"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/380cbe14e6dd2da0a57d7cd049ab27f2c8497fb2cf4cd4805b47d339f5fc6f42.png","width":449,"height":504,"width_mm":56.9},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cb660019cc5b1652e0a5cee45406f206fd5ccc004336032f450967845ac9b133.png","width":451,"height":511,"width_mm":57.1},{"type":"text","value":"(5) (2 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"E=0.95\\pm0.02\\ V"},{"type":"math","value":"r=1.2\\pm0.2\\ k\\Omega"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jinliqu-shierxiao-2512-q15","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jinliqu-shierxiao-2512","source_question_id":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2512-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"47173cad3a470e0f0bdf7edfb8a46dd08e82c062e5bb5d7edfdc328f9123b013","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）2022年3月21日，东航MU5735航班在广西境内失事，坠机过程中由于气压强大而导致客机解体，某研究团队针对此次事故试图研制一种压力感应自救器，如图所示，使密闭导热气缸内充有某种气体。左侧安装一个可视为光滑的横截面积为 S 的活塞，气缸左侧长度足够，压力正常时活塞静止在某处，气缸内气体温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，密度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。气缸内放有一密封的塑料开关感应器，体积为 V，正常状态时塑料开关感应器静止于气缸底部。当外界压力缓慢增大到 F 时，塑料开关感应器浮起，从而开启自救装置，这一过程中气缸内气体温度可视为不变。已知大气压强为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，所有过程中塑料开关感应器的体积视为不变。\n（1）在缓慢推动活塞的过程中，缸内气体单位体积内的分子数（填空）（选填“增加”、“不变”或“减少”)，在此过程中，气体分子的平均动能（填空）（选填“变大”、“变小”或“不变”）。\n(2) 求开关感应器的质量;\n（3）若在初始状态时不施加外力而是气缸内气体温度降低，当温度达到多少时，塑料开关感应器才能浮起？若在降温过程中，气缸内气体对外界释放了 Q 的热量，且活塞始终未移动，求气体内能的变化量 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ec04be225fec793607511a2a1419bd110531cc67020a55137b25c6baadba227b.png","width":308,"height":195,"width_mm":36.055,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2512-q15-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）\n解：（1）增加 不变 ……2分\n(2) 气体发生等温变化时"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}V_{0}=p_{1}V_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"又由于"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho=\\frac{m}{V}"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{P_{0}}{\\rho_{0}}=\\frac{P_{1}}{\\rho_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"当力为F时"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}S=p_{0}S+F"},{"type":"text","value":"，\n感应器刚好能浮起，浮力等于重力，即"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho_{1}gV=mg"},{"type":"text","value":"联立解得"},{"type":"math","value":"m=\\frac{(F+P_{0}S)\\rho_{0}}{SP_{0}}V"},{"type":"text","value":"……3分\n（3）气体发生等压变化时有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_{0}}{T_{0}}=\\frac{V_{1}}{T_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho=\\frac{m}{V}"},{"type":"text","value":"可知"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho_{0}T_{0}=\\rho_{1}T_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"乒乓球刚好能浮起，说明浮力等于重力，即"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho_{1}gV=mg"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}=\\frac{P_{0}S}{F+P_{0}S}T_{0}\\quad\\ldots\\ldots2"},{"type":"text","value":"分\n所以"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=W+Q"},{"type":"text","value":"可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=-Q"},{"type":"math","value":"\\ldots\\ldots1"},{"type":"text","value":"分"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jinliqu-shierxiao-2512-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jinliqu-shierxiao-2512","source_question_id":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2512-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"214151e2eb30e02453d130555d89b49e2cc75d4962fc8886ba29f729f930be6c","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）如图所示，AB为足够长的粗糙斜面，斜面倾角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，与水平面CG通过极小的一段光滑曲面平滑连接，CG长为S=1.2m的粗糙水平面，DFE为与水平面平滑连接的光滑竖直圆轨道，该竖直光滑圆轨道在CG的位置可调，最低点D、E水平方向略微错开。长木板紧挨着G，静止在光滑、足够长的水平面HI上。长木板右端固定一弹性挡板K（物块与它的碰撞为弹性碰撞）。一质量为m=1kg可视为的质点物块P自斜面上距水平面高为h处由静止释放，p与斜面、CG间、木板间动摩擦因素均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu=0.5"},{"type":"text","value":" 。圆轨道半径R=0.4m，木板质量M=2Kg，长为L=2m。 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin37^{\\circ}=0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos37^{\\circ}=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" ，取 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求：\n（1）若滑块恰能过最高点 "},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求滑块经 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 点时受到轨道的支持力大小。\n（2）当 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_1 = 3.3\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时， "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 的距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为多少时滑块恰能滑过 "},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":" 点。\n（3）当圆轨道最低点 D 位于 CG 中点时，p 刚好滑至木板中点时与木板相对静止，求滑块释放的高度 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/63c271526ede46e172a359fc0bd268474de0d22ad7c5ab1a197e83977a208303.png","width":887,"height":235,"width_mm":104.202,"row_group":"jinliqu-shierxiao-2512-q16-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）(1) p 恰能经 F:"},{"type":"math","value":"mg=m\\frac{v_{F}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"① 解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F}=2m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"…1 分\np 自 D 到 F，由机械能守恒定律："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{D}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{F}^{2}+2mgR"},{"type":"text","value":"② 解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D}=2\\sqrt{5}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"…1 分\np 经 D 时："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}-mg=m\\frac{v_{D}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"③ 代入数据解得："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=60N"},{"type":"text","value":"…1 分\n（2）对 p，自释放到 F，由动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{mgh}_{1}-\\mu\\mathrm{mg}\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{h}_{1}}{\\tan37^{\\circ}}+s_{1}\\right)-2mgR=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{F}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"…1 分\n由（1）知："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F}=2m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"代入数据解得："},{"type":"math","value":"s_{1}=0.2m"},{"type":"text","value":"…1分\n（3）当圆轨道位于 CG 中点时，能过 F 点："},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{mgh}_{2}-\\mu mg\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{h}_{2}}{\\tan37^{\\circ}}+\\frac{s}{2}\\right)-2mgR=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{F}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}=3.9m"},{"type":"text","value":"…1 分\n设经 G 速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，恰第 1 次滑至第一块木板的中点，对 p 和木板组成的系统：\n由动量守恒定律："},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{mv}_{1} = (\\mathrm{M} + \\mathrm{m}) \\mathrm{v}_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"… 1 分\n由能量守恒定律："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}(M+m)v_{\\text{共}}^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\mu mgL"},{"type":"text","value":"解得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=\\sqrt{15}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"…1分\n对滑块 p，自释放到 G，由动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{mgh}_{3}-\\mu mg(\\frac{\\mathrm{h}_{3}}{\\tan37^{\\circ}}+s)=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{3}=4.05m"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{3}>h_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"符合题意 ...1 分\n当物块与挡板碰后在木板中点与木板相对静止，\n由能量守恒定律："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{2}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}(M+m)v_{\\text{共}}^{2}+\\frac{3}{2}\\mu mgL"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}=3\\sqrt{5}m/s"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{2}=(m+M)v_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"对滑块 p，自释放到 G，由动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{mgh}_{4}-\\mu mg(\\frac{\\mathrm{h}_{4}}{\\tan37^{\\circ}}+s)=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得："},{"type":"math","value":"h_{4}=8.55m\\ldots1"},{"type":"text","value":"分所以："},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}=4.05m"},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"math","value":"8.55m\\ldots1"},{"type":"text","va